: "* Geometric Application of Calculus.", "x0": 0.19358288770053475, "y0": 0.8355371900826446, "x1": 0.49518716577540106, "y1": 0.8479338842975207}, {"text": "NOTE: Late submissions incur a penalty as indicated in the Assessment Policy.", "x0": 0.10588235294117647, "y0": 0.8528925619834711, "x1": 0.73475935828877, "y1": 0.8661157024793389}], [{"text": "Outcomes to be assessed the student should be able to:", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.09338842975206611, "x1": 0.6064171122994653, "y1": 0.10330578512396695}, {"text": "MA12-1: uses detailed algebraic and graphical techniques to critically construct, model and", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.12479338842975207, "x1": 0.7818181818181819, "y1": 0.13636363636363635}, {"text": "evaluate", "x0": 0.7871657754010695, "y0": 0.12479338842975207, "x1": 0.8481283422459893, "y1": 0.13388429752066117}, {"text": "arguments in a range of familiar and unfamiliar contexts", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.1396694214876033, "x1": 0.5283422459893048, "y1": 0.15123966942148762}, {"text": "MA12-3: applies calculus techniques to model and solve problems", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.15454545454545454, "x1": 0.6042780748663101, "y1": 0.16611570247933885}, {"text": "MA12-5: applies the concepts and techniques of periodic functions in the solution of problems", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.17024793388429751, "x1": 0.8010695187165775, "y1": 0.18181818181818182}, {"text": "involving", "x0": 0.8074866310160428, "y0": 0.17024793388429751, "x1": 0.8684491978609625, "y1": 0.18181818181818182}, {"text": "trigonometric graphs", "x0": 0.12620320855614972, "y0": 0.18512396694214875, "x1": 0.2748663101604278, "y1": 0.19669421487603306}, {"text": "MA12-6: applies appropriate differentiation methods to solve problems", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.2, "x1": 0.6331550802139038, "y1": 0.2115702479338843}, {"text": "MA12-9: chooses and uses appropriate technology effectively in a range of contexts, models", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.21570247933884298, "x1": 0.7935828877005348, "y1": 0.22727272727272727}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.8, "y0": 0.21570247933884298, "x1": 0.8245989304812834, "y1": 0.22479338842975208}, {"text": "applies critical thinking to recognise appropriate times for such use", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.23057851239669422, "x1": 0.6064171122994653, "y1": 0.2421487603305785}, {"text": "MA12-10: constructs arguments to prove and justify results and provides reasoning to support", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.24545454545454545, "x1": 0.8032085561497326, "y1": 0.25702479338842976}, {"text": "conclusions which are appropriate to the context", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.2611570247933884, "x1": 0.47593582887700536, "y1": 0.2727272727272727}, {"text": "PLAGIARISM STATEMENT", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.3049586776859504, "x1": 0.332620320855615, "y1": 0.3140495867768595}, {"text": "By submitting the task for grading and/or marking, | acknowledge the following;", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.33553719008264465, "x1": 0.6941176470588235, "y1": 0.34710743801652894}, {"text": "The work submitted is my own work (unless appropriate acknowledgement has been", "x0": 0.1572192513368984, "y0": 0.3586776859504132, "x1": 0.7946524064171123, "y1": 0.3702479338842975}, {"text": "made).", "x0": 0.8010695187165775, "y0": 0.3586776859504132, "x1": 0.8502673796791443, "y1": 0.3702479338842975}, {"text": "\u00a9 Where the work of others is used and not acknowledged, a finding of Plagiarism will", "x0": 0.1572192513368984, "y0": 0.38099173553719007, "x1": 0.788235294117647, "y1": 0.3925619834710744}, {"text": "be made", "x0": 0.7946524064171123, "y0": 0.38099173553719007, "x1": 0.8566844919786096, "y1": 0.39008264462809916}, {"text": "and a zero grade or N/A will be awarded.", "x0": 0.18609625668449198, "y0": 0.4041322314049587, "x1": 0.4802139037433155, "y1": 0.41570247933884297}, {"text": "Student signature: Date:", "x0": 0.12727272727272726, "y0": 0.452892561